         <title>CCDASTRO Workflow Manager 1.1.37</title>
         <description>
            <p>Configurable PixInsight post-processing workflow manager.</p>
            <ul>
               <li>v1.1.37 recovers from missing, invalid or failing luminance stretch icons without repeating completed RGB processing</li>
               <li>Choose automatic matching, change the stretch choice, or keep RGB and continue to final reviews and saving</li>
               <li>Each retry starts from an untouched linear luminance copy; failed temporary copies are closed</li>
               <li>Includes updated README and website instructions</li>
            </ul>
         </description>
